      "type": "stat",
      "description": "How many scheduled tasks are not currently running. A task can be stopped because it was disabled, because it hit an error and was configured to stop on error, or because the database is paused or running on a passive DR replica (it resumes automatically once the database is active again). A non-zero value means some scheduled work is not happening, so check the status table below to see which tasks and why."
    },
